    "title": "Data From: Emulation of Cardiac Mechanics using Graph Neural Networks",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7075055",
    "publication_date": "2022-09-13",
    "description": "<p>Contains simulation results of the forward displacement from beginning to end-diastole for approximately 3000 synthetically generated left ventricle geometries.</p>\n\n<p>The simulation results are split into training, validation and test data.</p>\n\n<p>The data is described in detail in a forthcoming publication in <em>Computer Methods in Applied Mechanics and Engineering</em> - further information will be provided upon publication. A GitHub repository will also be made available, with code for processing the simulation data and training a Graph Neural Network emulator.</p>",
